  "definitions": {
    "commercial": "Caller-supplied HCAD base_ar (Base Area). HCAD Definition_help states that Base Area equals Building Area for commercial properties. A recognized label is a caller-supplied format check only and does not verify the figure against the publisher. Not actual area (act_ar), not account bld_ar, not rentable area, and not a sum of building rows."
  },
